WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.299
Welcome to Module 11 Advanced SQL CTEs and Window
Functions The

00:00:06.326 --> 00:00:11.852
word advanced can make these topics sound harder
than they are Most of the

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:18.118
difficulty comes from two questions First what does
each intermediate result represent

00:00:19.026 --> 00:00:24.790
Second which related rows are visible to the current
calculation We

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:30.369
will answer those questions gradually with Common
Table Expressions recursive CTEs window functions

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:36.290
ranking LAG and LEAD and explicit window frames
Every SQL

00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:40.988
example can run directly in the browser and you can
also copy it into pgAdmin
